course: dictionary
lesson: 10608
title: Undress: taking clothes off
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: To undress means to take your clothes off. You can undress yourself, as in «Get undressed for bed», or you can undress someone else, such as a baby or a doll.
explain: Undress is an everyday word for bath time, bedtime and PE. Its verb forms are undress, undresses, undressed and undressing, so you might read «Undress for your bath» or «I undressed for bed».
explain: «In a state of undress» is a formal or jokey phrase meaning not fully dressed. You will mostly meet it in stories, not in everyday talk.
explain: Your body is private. You get changed in private spaces, and nobody should ask you to undress or take photos of you. If anyone does, tell a trusted adult straight away.
fact: Undress means to take clothes off. Undress someone means to take their clothes off for them.
fact: «Undressed» is the past form: «I undressed before my bath.»
fact: «In a state of undress» means not fully dressed.
fact: «They instructed his housekeeper to feed him, undress him, and put him to bed.» Here undress him means take his clothes off so he can go to bed.
exercise: «Get undressed for bed.» What does undressed mean? | Tidied your bedroom | *Taken your clothes off | Washed your hair | Put your pyjamas on
exercise: Mum says, «Undress for your bath, then hop in.» What should you do first? | Lie down on the sofa | Brush your teeth | Put your shoes on | *Take off your clothes
exercise: «The housekeeper had to undress him and put him to bed.» What does undress mean here? | Read him a story | *Take his clothes off | Dress him in a warm coat | Wash his face
test: What does «in a state of undress» mean? | Wearing a uniform | *Not fully dressed | Ready to go out | Very tidy and smart
test: Yesterday I ___ before my bath. | undresses | undress | *undressed | undressing
exam: If someone asks you to undress and take photos, what should you do? | *Tell a trusted adult straight away | Do it if they are a friend | Keep it secret, because you might get in trouble | Do it quickly so they will stop asking
